implementationPlan.description:
Add a production guard in gateway startup (gateway.go, near line 496-511 in the RunWithAuth function): If `env.IsProduction()` is true and `CORDUM_DASHBOARD_EMBED_API_KEY` env var is truthy, log a CRITICAL warning. Do not refuse to start (that would break existing deployments), but make it impossible to miss:
```go
if env.IsProduction() && env.Bool("CORDUM_DASHBOARD_EMBED_API_KEY") {
    slog.Error("SECURITY WARNING: CORDUM_DASHBOARD_EMBED_API_KEY is enabled in production — API key will be exposed in browser JavaScript")
}
```
